# Clickable demo of the API. Start the stack first: `make up` (or `docker compose up --build`).
# VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client), then click "Send Request"
# above each block, top to bottom.
# Later requests reuse ids from earlier responses, so run them in order.
# Concurrency and the crash-mid-payment case can't be expressed here: run `make e2e` for those.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@key = Bearer sk_test_demo123

### Health (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

### Register the demo webhook sink (watch deliveries with `make logs`)
POST {{base}}/webhook_endpoints
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://psp:8081/webhook-sink"}

### Wrong API key -> 401
GET {{base}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer nope

### Create a customer
# @name customer
POST {{base}}/customers
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ada Lovelace", "email": "ada@example.com"}

### Client-sent total is rejected -> 400
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "due_date": "2026-11-30",
  "total_cents": 1,
  "line_items": [{"description": "Consulting", "quantity": 2, "unit_amount_cents": 15000}]
}

### Create an invoice: server computes total_cents = 30000, status = draft
# @name invoice
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "due_date": "2026-11-30",
  "line_items": [{"description": "Consulting", "quantity": 2, "unit_amount_cents": 15000}]
}

### Pay a draft -> 409 invalid_state_transition
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_success"}

### Finalize: draft -> open
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/finalize
Authorization: {{key}}

### Finalize again -> 409 invalid_state_transition
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/finalize
Authorization: {{key}}

### Pay with a declined card -> 402, invoice stays open
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_card_declined"}

### Pay with insufficient funds -> 402
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_insufficient_funds"}

### Pay successfully -> 200, invoice paid (fixed key so the next two requests can reuse it)
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pay-{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}

{"card_token": "tok_success"}

### Same key, same body -> identical saved response, no second PSP call
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pay-{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}

{"card_token": "tok_success"}

### Same key, different body -> 422 idempotency_key_reused
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pay-{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}

{"card_token": "tok_card_declined"}

### New key on a paid invoice -> 409 invalid_state_transition
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_success"}

### Void a paid invoice -> 409 (paid is terminal)
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{invoice.response.body.$.id}}/void
Authorization: {{key}}

### ---- PSP timeout: second invoice ----
# @name slow
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "due_date": "2026-11-30",
  "line_items": [{"description": "Slow card", "quantity": 1, "unit_amount_cents": 999}]
}

### Finalize the slow invoice
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{slow.response.body.$.id}}/finalize
Authorization: {{key}}

### tok_timeout -> 202 with a pending attempt after ~3 s (doesn't wait for the PSP's 30 s)
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{slow.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_timeout"}

### While pending: void -> 409 payment_in_progress
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{slow.response.body.$.id}}/void
Authorization: {{key}}

### Check status: "open" now, "paid" once the sweeper settles it (~30 s+)
GET {{base}}/invoices/{{slow.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: {{key}}

### ---- PSP network error: third invoice ----
# @name flaky
POST {{base}}/invoices
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{customer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "due_date": "2026-11-30",
  "line_items": [{"description": "Flaky network", "quantity": 1, "unit_amount_cents": 500}]
}

### Finalize the flaky invoice
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{flaky.response.body.$.id}}/finalize
Authorization: {{key}}

### tok_network_error -> 202 pending (PSP charged, then dropped the connection)
POST {{base}}/invoices/{{flaky.response.body.$.id}}/pay
Authorization: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"card_token": "tok_network_error"}

### Check status: settles to "paid" via the sweeper, never double-charged
GET {{base}}/invoices/{{flaky.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: {{key}}

### ---- Listing ----
### Open invoices
GET {{base}}/invoices?status=open
Authorization: {{key}}

### All customers
GET {{base}}/customers
Authorization: {{key}}
